 "note": "M axis, fixed beat path: k = 1, C fixed (c_fixed), beat_ns_0 > beat_ns_1 > ... (halving); every tier's duration, the drain after it included, must be a multiple of its beat; register once per output length; TEMPLATE: every TBD value is filled at registration from the E1 / E2a results (fast track, exploratory)"
}
